## Environment Strategy

| Environment | Purpose | API Key | Rate Limit | Data Access |
|-------------|---------|---------|------------|-------------|
| Development | Local dev | Dev/Sandbox | Low (10/min) | Test data only |
| Staging | Pre-prod testing | Staging key | Medium (50/min) | Limited prod |
