## Evernote Data Model

```
User
├── Notebooks (max 250-1000)
│   └── Notes (max 100,000)
│       ├── Content (ENML format)
│       ├── Resources (attachments)
│       ├── Tags (many-to-many)
│       └── Attributes (metadata)
├── Tags (max 100,000)
└── Saved Searches (max 100)
