### Step 2: Review Breaking Changes

```javascript
// SDK 1.x -> 2.x Breaking Changes

// 1. Client initialization changed
// OLD (1.x):
var Evernote = require('evernote').Evernote;
var client = new Evernote.Client({
  consumerKey: 'key',
  consumerSecret: 'secret',
  sandbox: true
});

// NEW (2.x):
