  "error": "export_failed",
  "message": "Unable to export presentation",
  "format": "pdf"
}
```

**Solutions:**
1. Verify presentation exists and is complete
2. Check supported export formats
3. Ensure no pending generation jobs
4. Try exporting with lower quality setting

