## Data Classification

| Category | Examples | Retention | Access |
|----------|----------|-----------|--------|
| Public | Name, title, company | 1 year | All users |
| Contact | Email, phone | 90 days | Recruiters only |
| Sensitive | SSN, salary | 30 days | Admins only |
