## Migration Sources

| Source | Complexity | Common Issues |
|--------|------------|---------------|
| LinkedIn Recruiter | Medium | Rate limits, field mapping |
| Greenhouse | Low | Well-documented API |
| Lever | Low | Standard export format |
| Custom ATS | High | Custom transformation needed |
