## Webhook Event Types

| Event | Description | Use Case |
|-------|-------------|----------|
| `trace.created` | New trace started | Real-time monitoring |
| `trace.updated` | Trace modified | Error detection |
| `generation.created` | LLM call logged | Token tracking |
