npm test

# Run type checking
npx tsc --noEmit

# Run linting
npm run lint
```

### Step 8: Test in Staging
```bash
# Deploy to staging
npm run deploy:staging

# Run integration tests against staging
npm run test:integration
```

### Step 9: Gradual Rollout
```typescript
