## Data Classification

| Category | Examples | Handling |
|----------|----------|----------|
| Translation Keys | `welcome.message`, `error.network` | Standard |
| UI Text | "Welcome!", "Submit" | Standard |
| Dynamic Content | `Hello, {name}` | Review for PII |
