- Staging environment

## Instructions

### Step 1: Check Current Version

```bash
# Node.js SDK
npm list @mistralai/mistralai
npm view @mistralai/mistralai versions --json | jq '.[-5:]'

# Python SDK
pip show mistralai
pip index versions mistralai 2>/dev/null || pip install mistralai==

# Check for outdated
