## Performance Targets

| Metric | Target | Critical |
|--------|--------|----------|
| Clinical Query P50 | < 3s | > 10s |
| Clinical Query P95 | < 8s | > 15s |
| Clinical Query P99 | < 15s | > 30s |
| DeepConsult Start | < 5s | > 15s |
| Cache Hit Rate | > 70% | < 50% |

