## Version Compatibility Matrix

| SDK Version | API Version | Node.js | Python | Status |
|-------------|-------------|---------|--------|--------|
| 3.x | v3 | 20+ | 3.11+ | Current |
| 2.x | v2 | 18+ | 3.10+ | Maintained |
| 1.x | v1 | 16+ | 3.8+ | Deprecated |

